<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s003/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2792 ;
    djr:text "\n도메인 언어(유비쿼터스 언어), 비즈니스 정책·상태 전이, 애그리거트 경계, 바운디드 컨텍스트 경계, 도메인 이벤트 채택 여부가 불명확할 때 로드한다. 경계:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s003/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2793 ;
    djr:text "- Django ORM·서비스 레이어·outbox 구현 → `implementation-django`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s003/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2794 ;
    djr:text "- outbox 전달 보장·트랜잭션 격리·Risky Write 설계 → `architecture-db`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s003/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2795 ;
    djr:text "- REST API 계약·엔드포인트 설계 → `architecture-api`\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 핵심 운영 원칙"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2796 ;
    djr:text "\n- 전략 설계가 전술 패턴보다 먼저다: 핵심 도메인 식별 → 바운디드 컨텍스트 설계 → 컨텍스트 맵 → 전술 패턴 적용. 전략 없이 전술 패턴만 적용하면 \"잘못된 경계에서 좋은 코드를 작성하는 결과\"가 된다 (§1.2, §2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2814 ;
    djr:text "- 구현 패턴(Data Mapper, Repository+UoW, Event Sourcing, Saga, CQRS)은 명확한 필요가 확인된 시점에 선택하고, 패턴 선택 절차를 통해 Risky Write 라우팅을 포함해 결정한다 (§6.8)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2797 ;
    djr:text "- 유비쿼터스 언어는 바운디드 컨텍스트 내에서만 유효하다 — 동일 개념도 컨텍스트가 다르면 다른 언어를 쓴다 (§2.3)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2798, djr:R-2799, djr:R-2800, djr:R-2801 ;
    djr:text "- 애그리거트는 Vernon의 4가지 규칙을 따른다: 진짜 불변식만 경계 안에서 보호, 최소 크기 설계, 타 애그리거트는 ID로만 참조(영속성/ORM 포함 — BC 경계 ORM FK 금지, 같은 BC 내 FK는 허용), 경계 밖 일관성은 결과적 일관성으로 달성 (§3.3)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2802 ;
    djr:text "- 엔티티는 애그리거트의 일부로만 사용하고, 독립적으로 생성·접근하지 않는다 (§3.2, §8)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2803, djr:R-2804 ;
    djr:text "- 도메인 서비스는 여러 애그리거트에 걸친 무상태 도메인 로직에 사용하고, 애그리거트는 도메인 서비스를 직접 알지 않는다 (§3.5)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2805 ;
    djr:text "- 응용 서비스는 흐름 제어와 트랜잭션 관리만 담당하고, 비즈니스 로직을 두지 않는다 (§3.6)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2806, djr:R-2807 ;
    djr:text "- 도메인 이벤트는 애그리거트가 수집하고, UoW 커밋 직전(동일 트랜잭션 내 부수 효과) 또는 직후(외부 통합)에 디스패치 타이밍을 명시한다. 타이밍이 불명확하면 이벤트 유실이나 트랜잭션 불일치가 발생한다 (§3.7)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2808, djr:R-2809, djr:R-2810, djr:R-2811 ;
    djr:text "- 발행 이벤트 봉투의 discriminator(`event_type` 류)는 1종째부터 domain_layer `StrEnum`으로 선언하고(birth-enum) append-only로 유지한다 — 버전 태그(`payload_schema_version`)는 리터럴 동결, 소비 BC는 발행 enum을 import하지 않는다 (§3.7)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2812, djr:R-2813 ;
    djr:text "- 아키텍처는 4계층+DIP를 기본으로 한다: 도메인이 인프라를 직접 알지 않도록 도메인 영역에 인터페이스를 두고 인프라에서 구현한다 (§5.1, §5.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 상세 레퍼런스"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2815 ;
    djr:text "\n주제별로 [`references/final.md`](references/final.md)의 해당 절을 따른다:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:text "| 복잡성 관리 원칙 | §7 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:text "| 의사결정 요약 | §8 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2816 ;
    djr:text "각 절은 [`references/final.md`](references/final.md)에서 필요한 항목만 읽는다(전체 로드 불필요).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/SKILL.md/s005/b2> a djr:Block ;
